### Register
POST https://localhost/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123"
}

### Login
POST https://localhost/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get Current User (me)
GET https://localhost/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Logout
POST https://localhost/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Refresh Token
POST https://localhost/api/v1/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List Users
GET https://localhost/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Search Users
GET https://localhost/api/v1/users/search?q=john
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get User by ID
GET https://localhost/api/v1/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update User
PUT https://localhost/api/v1/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "John Updated"
}

### Delete User
DELETE https://localhost/api/v1/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
